# Local-only tools. GitHub Pages publishes every file at the repository root,
# so anything committed here is public at a guessable URL on khipuai.co.
# These are working tools, not part of the site, and must stay out of git.
mobile-preview.html

# The local list of client names and billing codes for the client-name check
# (tests/confidential.mjs). The repository is public: never commit this file.
# In GitHub Actions the same list comes from the CONFIDENTIAL_TERMS secret.
tests/.confidential-terms

